  <string name="onboarding_pinetime_config_install_firmware_btn">安装 PineTime 固件</string>
  <string name="onboarding_pinetime_config_firmware_note">将专用 OpenSeizureDetector 固件安装到 PineTime 手表，使其收集并发送发作检测所需的数据。\n更新过程中将请求蓝牙访问权限和通知权限，以显示进度。</string>
